# Submodules tracked by this repository.
#
# Every path listed here is recorded in the index as a gitlink (mode 160000).
# Each needs a `url`, because `git submodule update --init` -- which is what
# `git clone --recursive` runs -- has no way to obtain a gitlink's contents
# without one. A gitlink with no entry here makes `git submodule status`
# abort with:
#
#     fatal: no submodule mapping found in .gitmodules for path '<path>'
#
# and makes `git clone --recursive` fail outright after checkout.
#
# URLs are each checkout's own `origin`, verified with
# `git remote get-url origin` from inside the submodule.
#
# NOTE: the six nested checkouts ignored in .gitignore
# (/vansrouter/, /tau/, /boundless/, /sigma/, /omp-semantic-policy/,
# /barn/woodpecker/) are deliberately NOT listed here. They are ignored
# rather than tracked, so they contribute no gitlinks and need no entry.

# --- generated 2026-10-04T00:12:09Z: one entry per tracked gitlink,
#     url = each checkout's own origin ---
